  "sourceNotes": {
    "rawContent": "Add a personal touch to your style with this Initial Letter Ring! Crafted on premium brass metal with fine gold plating, it delivers the shine and elegance of real gold jewellery.\nFeatures:\n- Long-Lasting Shine: The sturdy brass base keeps the ring looking bright and new for a long time with proper care.\n- Adjustable/Comfort Fit: Designed for everyday wear — lightweight and comfortable on the finger.\n- Perfect Gift: A thoughtful, personalized gift option featuring your own or a loved one's initial.\nCare Tips:\n- Remove the ring before bathing, swimming, washing hands with soap, or heavy sweating to help the plating last longer.\n- Wipe gently with a clean, dry cloth after use.\n- Avoid direct contact with perfume, lotion, or hand sanitizer.\n- Store in a dry place, away from moisture, when not wearing it.",
